## WEEK 1 PROMPT: Document Upload + PDF Viewer

**Project Context:**
Building an invoice batch processing webapp. This is Phase 1 of 7. The goal is a working vertical slice: user can upload a PDF and view it rendered in the browser. No OCR yet—just ingestion and display.

